<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>My Profile | Prep4Int</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/profile.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css"><link rel="icon" href="/img/fevi.png"></head>
<body>
<nav class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/index"><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="">Prep4Int</a><div class="links"><a href="/index">Home</a><a href="/alltopics.html">Topics</a><a href="/que.html">Questions</a><a href="/rec.html">Recommendations</a></div><a class="logout" href="/logout">Log out</a></nav>
<main class="wrap">
<header class="heading"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SPACE</p><h1>My Profile</h1><p class="muted">Manage your account and track your DSA journey.</p></header>
<section class="hero card"><div class="avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></div><div class="identity"><p class="eyebrow">WELCOME BACK</p><h2>{{user.fullname}}</h2><p class="muted">@<span id="profile-username">{{user.username}}</span> · {{user.email}}</p></div><a class="outline" href="/index">Dashboard <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></a></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PERFORMANCE</p><h2>DSA Progress</h2><p class="muted">Your saved question progress, all in one place.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/que.html">Practice questions <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div>
<div class="stats"><article class="stat card"><span class="icon green"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i></span><p class="muted">Solved</p><strong id="solved-count">—</strong></article><article class="stat card"><span class="icon blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i></span><p class="muted">Total questions</p><strong id="total-count">—</strong></article><article class="stat card"><span class="icon orange"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i></span><p class="muted">Remaining</p><strong id="remaining-count">—</strong></article></div>
<article class="card panel"><div class="progress-head"><div><h3>Overall completion</h3><p class="muted" id="progress-caption">Loading your progress…</p></div><strong id="progress-percent">0%</strong></div><div class="track"><div id="overall-progress" class="fill"></div></div></article>
<article class="card panel"><h3>Topic-wise progress</h3><p class="muted">See your progress in each DSA topic.</p><div id="topic-progress" class="topic-grid"><span class="muted">Loading topics…</span></div></article><p id="progress-error" class="feedback" role="status"></p></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT PREFERENCES</p><h2>Account Settings</h2><p class="muted">Update your login details securely.</p></div></div><div class="settings">
<article class="card setting"><div class="setting-title"><span class="icon blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-at"></i></span><div><h3>Change username</h3><p class="muted">Choose a unique username.</p></div></div><form id="username-form"><label for="new-username">New username</label><input id="new-username" type="text" minlength="3" maxlength="30" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]{3,30}" value="{{user.username}}" required><small>3–30 characters: letters, numbers, _ and -</small><button type="submit">Save username</button><p id="username-feedback" class="feedback" role="status"></p></form></article>
<article class="card setting"><div class="setting-title"><span class="icon blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></span><div><h3>Change password</h3><p class="muted">Confirm your current password first.</p></div></div><form id="password-form"><label for="current-password">Current password</label><input id="current-password" type="password" maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password" required><label for="new-password">New password</label><input id="new-password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" required><label for="confirm-password">Confirm new password</label><input id="confirm-password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" required><small>Use 12–128 characters.</small><button type="submit">Update password</button><p id="password-feedback" class="feedback" role="status"></p></form></article></div></section>
<footer>Prep4Int · Keep learning, keep improving.</footer></main><script src="/js/profile.js" defer></script></body></html>